  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to Peaceful and Safe Societies 2024-2031&apos; - CIVIC - Advancing Peace and Security: Protecting Civilians in Armed Conflict</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CIVIC will strengthen policy and programming for POC so that civilians experience a significant reduction in conflict-related harm.This will be achieved through three interlinked results and key steps across programmes in Mali, Somalia, Yemen, and global policy-research:#1: Civilians bring about improved protection for their communities.#2: Governments and armed actors are responsive to civilian protection needs and concerns, leaving nobody behind and doing no harm.#3: Regional and multinational bodies take concrete steps to improve POC at international, national, and local levels.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict-affected civilians in Somalia, Mali, and Yemen</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership with the Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs towards the goal of a significant reduction in conflict-related civilian harm</narrative>
  </description>
