   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 2:  Governments and armed actors are more responsive to civilian protection needs and concerns.</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sub-result: Governments and armed actors directly respond to specific, local protection needs and concerns of civilians through inclusive, and conflict-sensitive approaches (leaving nobody behind and doing no harm)Sub-result: Armed actors and governments demonstrate resolve to improve the protection of civilians through national-level systems, policies, and practicesSub-result: Governments and armed actors engage (inform, consult, coordinate) with civil society to protect civilians</narrative>
